.TH QUIPU-PROPOSE 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-propose \- List, submit, accept or reject schema change proposals
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu propose\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-status\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
List, submit, accept or reject schema change proposals
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-status\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Status to record or filter
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
quipu\-propose\-list(1)
List schema change proposals, optionally by status
.TP
quipu\-propose\-submit(1)
Submit a schema change proposal
.TP
quipu\-propose\-accept(1)
Accept a pending proposal
.TP
quipu\-propose\-reject(1)
Reject a pending proposal
.TP
quipu\-propose\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
